, {"file_name": "03.png", "id": "2131092734129191", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622166_2131092737462524_8680641054341149174_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rjkvlCiuifsQ7kNvwHhJtq6&_nc_oc=Adq9Mv_TD0y--KGMbOApLntIOyzIY6cwXahXtcKBqfG3vENj95F4FY91H8vKwjCyU5k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUBZkGjkQqfll-KCpOT7yWZiFUemCuwD2M6Jz4fVsxm6A&oe=6B105FF7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8ip_ax4QH3oQ7kNvwEYIB0c&_nc_oc=AdruMz-1yLIP3CpRIvaEudjXNd7i-4MdlaulNLKnySxH5YoXGbnEAYTu4_AT5l4vRic&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQU_aL9TM1he2Cr34Q1vV5edYI6Dcr_XiBeWaW83MRPj2w&oe=6B10618A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=krfXZn5pMrYQ7kNvwGFhmTM&_nc_oc=AdoD7cBhJ4MDxvpdXO2dfnxNZvdKlxcCoU0ZJCOup3_DzPOzuEbylWIv2CGj_wBSqOI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQV3dvNHyJByPQHwZLL8jvbzhy0dQ2s62fzuAlRFdoFasw&oe=6B104EAF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ez_Bgrtg6kMQ7kNvwE_SKjU&_nc_oc=AdpG4Za2Y-I12NLR5hS1Awu4n994XIAAxCvfU4uTBL65nRdpwb9qAUOd3BH8h7QJYUQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUjCisakJlTINzKXPrvX7FVYhitPHmzUsabjBltioz2sA&oe=6B103803"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=seU83dK6mmEQ7kNvwEmyKuQ&_nc_oc=AdqnHJf849gMs2O5BZYhVs5e9TJIT1pT1vS66sGWOL6eLC7UsKCFYyKky5myAeYcPUU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWq14wgksHs5zNp9avWLEL3BlWuSKUFFy9zib153COnYQ&oe=6B106898"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FY9VAFbujnkQ7kNvwGo7CpJ&_nc_oc=AdqZ6ulrY6yv0Uo4ezA-rZ-1u--S5e1H6C